# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=cage
pkgver=0.2.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Kiosk compositor: runs one program full screen"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://github.com/cage-kiosk/cage"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc wlroots wayland libxkbcommon)
source=("https://github.com/cage-kiosk/cage/releases/download/v$pkgver/cage-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('557c194d18af7202a9ec2e8be6dd7129f6c16d0f4528f4079ba26ccd57b6ef88')

build() {
    meson setup cage-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -D man-pages=disabled
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
